---
import H1 from "../components/h1.astro";
import InfoLayout from "../layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
---

<InfoLayout>
     <div class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-dvh flex flex-col justify-between gap-32">
          <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-12">
               <H1> Get to know DabAZ </H1>

               <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                    DabAZ is a passionate <span class="text-zinc-100">software developer</span> and <span class="text-zinc-100">technology enthusiast</span>
                    dedicated to creating innovative digital solutions.
                    With expertise in modern web technologies and a focus on user experience, DabAZ builds applications that make a meaningful impact.
               </p>
               <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                    I started IT career in 2019, as an <span class="text-zinc-100">ethical hacker</span>. But I haven't been doing anything about cyber security since 2022. I am currently a software developer, working on web applications.
               </p>
               <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                    I make <span class="text-zinc-100"><a href="https://music.dabaz.me" target="_blank" class="underline decoration-zinc-600">music</a></span> as a hobby. Raised in China and United States, I was interested in pop, rock, and hip-hop music from a young age. I started my music career as a DJ in the band of his high school, which is Beijing Haidian Foreign Language Shi Yan School, before I began producing my own music. Inspired by Lil Pump and Juice WRLD, I began to make hip-hop music. Now, I makes different genres of music, including EDM, hip-hop, lo-fi, emo rap, trap, and rock.
               </p>
               <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                    I also <span class="text-zinc-100">design</span> as a hobby. I have designed a lot of different brands, including logos, websites, and social media profiles. With my music and design skills, I have also designed for individual artists, including their album covers and posters.
               </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-base sm:text-lg">
               <h2 class="px-4 text-zinc-400 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-500">Expertise</h2>

               <ul class="px-4 text-zinc-400 list-disc list-outside">
                    <li>Front-End Web Development</li>
                    <li>React & Next.js Applications</li>
                    <li>TypeScript & JavaScript</li>
                    <li>Modern UI/UX Design</li>
                    <li>Performance Optimization</li>
               </ul>
          </div>
     </div>
</InfoLayout>
